#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:111
msgid "Turn off CPU vulnerability protections"
msgstr "Bescherming tegen CPU-kwetsbaarheden uitschakelen"

#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:113
msgid ""
"Adds mitigations=off to the kernel command line, disabling the protections "
"against Spectre, Meltdown and similar processor flaws. Faster in some "
"workloads, but less secure. Applies after restart."
msgstr ""
"Voegt mitigations=off toe aan de kernelopdrachtregel en schakelt zo de "
"bescherming tegen Spectre, Meltdown en vergelijkbare processorlekken uit. "
"Sneller bij sommige taken, maar minder veilig. Wordt van kracht na herstart."

#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:118
msgid ""
"The kernel will stop protecting against processor flaws such as Spectre and "
"Meltdown. Some workloads get faster, but malicious programs or web pages may "
"be able to read data from other programs. The change applies after the next "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"De kernel beschermt niet langer tegen processorlekken zoals Spectre en "
"Meltdown. Sommige taken worden sneller, maar kwaadaardige programma’s of "
"webpagina’s kunnen mogelijk gegevens van andere programma’s lezen. De "
"wijziging wordt van kracht na de volgende herstart."

#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:120
msgid "Turn off protections"
msgstr "Bescherming uitschakelen"

#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:122
msgid "Meltdown"
msgstr "Meltdown"

#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:122
msgid "Spectre"
msgstr "Spectre"

#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:122
msgid "mitigations"
msgstr "mitigaties"

#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:128
msgid "Turn off lockup detectors"
msgstr "Lockupdetectie uitschakelen"

#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:130
msgid ""
"Adds nowatchdog and tsc=nowatchdog to the kernel command line, disabling the "
"kernel soft and hard lockup detectors and the TSC clocksource watchdog. "
"Applies after restart."
msgstr ""
"Voegt nowatchdog en tsc=nowatchdog toe aan de kernelopdrachtregel en schakelt"
" zo de soft- en hard-lockupdetectors van de kernel en de TSC-clocksource-"
"watchdog uit. Wordt van kracht na herstart."

#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:135
msgid ""
"The kernel will no longer detect and report processors that stop responding, "
"and will no longer check the stability of the TSC clock. Freezes may go "
"unreported and become harder to diagnose. The change applies after the next "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"De kernel detecteert en meldt niet langer processors die niet meer reageren "
"en controleert de stabiliteit van de TSC-klok niet meer. Vastlopers worden "
"mogelijk niet gemeld en zijn moeilijker te diagnosticeren. De wijziging wordt"
" van kracht na de volgende herstart."

#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:137
msgid "Turn off detectors"
msgstr "Detectors uitschakelen"

#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:138
msgid "nowatchdog"
msgstr "nowatchdog"

#: usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-settings/performance_page.py:138
msgid "watchdog"
msgstr "watchdog"

